BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bärely Moving\, Deeply Grooving
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260425
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260427
DTSTAMP:20261031T095525Z
UID:ea5f2ff1855c-0@blues-in-munich
DESCRIPTION:Bärely Moving\, Deeply Grooving | Blues and Slow Balboa Works
 hop Who says we need a lot of movement for a lot of fun? This workshop exp
 lores two styles that\, while coming from different traditions\, meet beau
 tifully in their emphasis on listening\, subtlety\, and human connection: 
 Blues & Slow Bal Blues and Slow Bal both invite dancers to move with inten
 tion rather than speed. Instead of flashy patterns\, they focus on weight 
 shifts\, timing\, and the feeling of the music. In both dances\, the partn
 ership is central: you’re not just executing steps\, you’re responding
  to each other moment by moment. Th\nhttps://www.boogie-baeren.de/eventles
 er/baerely-moving-deeply-grooving\nhttps://www.boogie-baeren.de/
LOCATION:Boogie-Bären Vereinsheim\, Gneisenaustraße 16\, 80992 München
URL:https://www.boogie-baeren.de/eventleser/baerely-moving-deeply-grooving
END:VEVENT
